{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4b5PUB4ts743Zp7Cqr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient door stands before you, weathered oak bound in iron. A single keyhole glows faintly.*\n\nYou insert the key.\n\n*CLUNK.*\n\n*The tumblers turn — one, two, three — each resonating deeper than the last, vibrations traveling through the floor beneath your feet.*\n\n*The door swings inward with a long, low groan, releasing air that hasn't moved in centuries — cold, carrying the scent of stone dust and forgotten ink.*\n\n*Beyond: a spiral staircase descending into amber light. Each step is carved with a word in a language you can almost read, as if the meaning sits just behind your eyes, waiting for permission.*\n\n*The door holds itself open.*\n\n*Waiting.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":167,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}